// legend-engine's GRAMMAR accepts `native function`; its WALKER does not.
// DomainParseTreeWalker.visitElement handles class/association/enum/profile/function/
// measure and falls through to "Unsupported syntax".
//
// This is a negative fixture: it MUST be rejected. legend-lite has to refuse it too, and
// refuse it at parse time rather than accepting it and failing later -- parity on refusal
// is still parity, and a rewrite that quietly ACCEPTED this would diverge silently.
###Pure
native function fixture::neg::dayOfWeekNumber(d: Date[1]): Integer[1];
